{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110989","id":2867134452,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6q5P_0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110989","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110989.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110989.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110989","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110989/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110989/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110989/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/800ff0e01ea2d3b6e3ba4eca60cf1a1dbb6e145c","number":110989,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix snap Polygon2D editor","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"* *fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110966*\r\n\r\n**Issue Description**\r\n\r\nWhen we drag a vertex of a Polygon from polygon editor.\r\n\r\n- Pressed mouse left key, record mouse position as `drag_from`\r\n- Drag to somewhere and release mouse, get mouse position as `drag_to`, depending on `grid snap` configuration, we will calculate with `snap_point()` to let mouse position snap to the grid\r\n- The problem is we used `drag_to - drag_from` as distance to update points of polygon, that caused very hard to drag  a vertex to snap the grid correctly. It should use snapped mouse position directly.\r\n\r\ne.g.\r\n\r\n- vertex position (1, 1)\r\n- grid (10, 10)\r\n- original mouse position (5, 5), we pressed mouse on (5,5)\r\n- target mouse position (10, 10), we released mouse on (10, 10). Maybe real position is (9,9) or (11,11), it will be snapped to (10, 10) as grid configuration.\r\n- The the distance is (10, 10) - (5, 5) = (5,5)\r\n- Finally, vertex will move to (1, 1) + (5,5) = (6,6), which is not snapped on grid.\r\n- We should let vertext move to (10, 10) directly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels"